==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
{{borrowing|eo|en|have}}.

=== Pronunciation ===

* {{IPA|/ˈhavi/|lang=eo}}
* {{hyphenation|ha|vi|lang=eo}}

===Verb===
{{eo-head}}

# to [[have]]
#: {{ux|eo|Mi '''havas''' elektran torĉon, sed mi ne '''havas''' bateriojn.|I '''have''' a flashlight, but I don't '''have''' batteries.}}

====Conjugation====
{{eo-conj}}

